Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你在做什么  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. What are you doing? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把沙发搬开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know, I was thinking of moving the couch over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要那样呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样子我就有好位置可以坐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that there would be a decent place for me to sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你本来就有好位置坐了  你的大腿不算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, there is a decent place to... And your lap does not count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  帮我把它搬开  不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Come on, help me move this. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要  不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萝希塔不想移开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rosita does not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  萝希塔  是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Rosita? As in--?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 "不想动的萝希塔"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As in "Rosita does not move."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  只不过是一张椅子  有什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, it's just a chair. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大不了的是  它到浴室跟到厨房的距离是一样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The big deal is that it's the exact equal distance from the bathroom to the kitchen...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且它的角度让你完全  看不到史提夫的反光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's at the perfect angle so you don't get any glare coming off of Stevie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电视机史提夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stevie the TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there a problem? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他又知道什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  萝希塔  我们这些辣妹得合作才行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Rosita. Us chicas gotta stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第13集  萝希塔之死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E13  The One Where Rosita Dies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过房地产广告版\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I was checking out the real-estate section.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像爸妈的房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it looks like Mom and Dad's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,院子里的树  正前方也有根断掉的树枝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it even has a tree with a broken limb out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阁楼的窗户\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the, uh, window in the attic...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  阁楼的窗户怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What happened to the window in the attic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信他们要把它卖掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe Mom and Dad are selling the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却没有告诉我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe they didn't even tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阁楼的窗户到底是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I still don't know what happened to the window in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我会买张新椅子赔你  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, come on. Joey, I'll buy you a new one, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上到店里去  帮你买一张新椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll go down to the store right now and we'll get you a new chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还尸骨未寒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's not even cold yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萝希塔难道不希望  你继续过你的日子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But don't you think Rosita would've wanted you to move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说她永远  把你的幸福放在第一位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you know, she did always put your comfort first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信  我们得跟小时候的家说再见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe we have to say goodbye to the house we grew up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  有个陌生人  就要搬进我的房间里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, some stranger's gonna be living in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,15年来  他们把你房间  弄得跟神宠差不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, after 15 years of Morn and Dad keeping it as a shrine to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在一切都该落幕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's time the velvet ropes came down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也保留你房间有一阵子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They kept your room a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我搬出来20分钟后  爸就把我的房间变成健身房了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, please. Dad turned my room into a gym 20 minutes after I moved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  一张日光浴椅  跟一堆维多利亚秘密的目录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I gotta say, a tanning bed and a stack of Victoria's Secret catalogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是健身房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not a gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  你知道他们爱你  就跟他们爱你一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. You know they love you. As much as they love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没出生前  他们以为她不会生  那不是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was their first born. They thought she was barren. It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌今年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. I hate this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今年有什么不对的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong with this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经是二月  我只接到两个按摩客人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's already February and I've only given two massages...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们给小费都给得很吝啬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and they were both the worst tippers in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指我跟罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was me and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, y'know if you want to pick up some extra cash...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大学的朋友  做电话行销赚了不少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...some friends of mine made good money in college doing telemarketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它一定比上次  我做的电话行销工作还棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it'd probably be better than the last telephone job I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我不必常常说 "打我屁股吧"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I probably won't have to say "spank" as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你从来没打过那种电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, like you never called.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很简单啊   你只要照着稿子念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, basically, this is very easy. You read from the script...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试着多卖一点碳粉就行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and try to sell as much toner as you possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我办得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我喜欢我的办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, by the way, I love my office. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么不来练习一下   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't we do a trial run? Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是帝国办公室文具公司的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, this is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问总务部经理在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I speak to your supply manager, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是总务部经理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the supply manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我想跟你谈谈买碳粉的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, okay. I'd like to talk to you about your toner needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要碳粉  好吧  抱歉打扰你了  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't need any toner. Well, I'm sorry to bother you. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  这工作真的很容易\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you're right. This is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  感觉那通电话哪里不对劲呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. What was wrong with that call?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有恶意  但你的态度真的很不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, no offense, but you were kind of rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:05:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们永远都会说  他们不需要碳粉  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're always gonna tell you they don't need toner, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他们说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because whatever they say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都会在稿子里找到标准答案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you can find the answer to it, here in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想  你准备好要卖碳粉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. So I think you're ready to sell toner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有问题吗  没有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have any last questions? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  对了  我的确有一个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, yes, I do. I do have one question:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是碳粉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is toner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}JOe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原封未动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Full bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒还是冰的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Beer's still cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里一定发生了很可怕的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something terrible must have happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史提夫  我没来过这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stevie, I was never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  我在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad? I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉上好像昨天  你们跑来看我工作的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, it seems like just yesterday you guys used to come out to watch me work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不敢相信你们要卖掉房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad, we can't believe you're selling the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也该让新的家庭  在这里开始他们的新生活了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, It's time for a new family to start their memories here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望在支票兑现前  他们不会发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And hopefully their check will clear before they find the crack...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地基有裂痕  天花板的石棉瓦破了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in the foundation and the asbestos in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们快把东西拿一拿  离开这里吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's just grab our stuff and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我们不能收藏你们过时的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry we can't store your childhood things anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我都等不及想要再看那些东西了  所有的回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's okay. I can't wait to see everything again. All the memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这里放了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what's in the boxes down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道  阁楼上有六 七箱简易烘焙烤箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I do know that there are six or seven Easy-Bake Ovens in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前最喜欢玩开餐厅的游戏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used to love to play restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你最爱的还是 "吃面粉糊"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, not as much as you loved to play "uncooked batter eater."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能要求小孩子  等着要电灯泡把蛋糕烤好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. It is unreasonable to expect a child to wait for a light bulb to cook brownies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你的箱子应该都在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I think your boxes are over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁的烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Dad, whose cigarettes are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是你妈的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They must be your mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但求求你别去质问她  我来扔掉吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But please, please don't ask her. I'll throw these away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷啊  爸  我的成绩单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cool. Dad, my report cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  快来看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, check this out. Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,数学 "优等"  自然"优等"  历史"优等"  体育\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Math, A. Science, A. History, A. Gym...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的磨石机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, my rock polisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨了  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道每年春天车库都会淹水吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how the garage floods every spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么把房子卖掉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you ever gonna sell this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我不小心拿摩妮卡的箱子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I accidentally used Monica's boxes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来挡水  免得保时捷进了水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to keep the water away from the Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  爸  爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, Dad. Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the--?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都毁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  她一定会崩溃的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad, she's gonna be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是偷偷在抽烟吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't secretly smoke, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以是你妈在抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it's just your mother, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是帝国办公室文具公司的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. This is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问总务部经理在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I speak to your supply manager, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厄尔  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Earl. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  厄尔  我是帝国办公室  文具公司的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Earl. This is Phoebe from Empire Office Supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你谈谈买碳粉的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like to talk to you about your toner needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要碳粉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't need any toner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  但是听了我们的价格  大家都会想买碳粉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm hearing what you're saying, but at our prices, everyone needs toner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能问你为什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I surely do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要碳粉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't need any toner...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我就要自杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I'm gonna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你的碳粉用完了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that because you're out of toner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  今天我不需要碳粉  谢谢你  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so no toner today. Thanks anyway. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等一下  我不能让你挂电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, wait, wait. I can't just let you hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你跟我说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just please talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我只需要做一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I only had one thing to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（今天的工作  自杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我能把它延期一下吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I could push it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你为什么要自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Now, why do you want to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十年来  我一直在做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been working for 10 years now at this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份没有意义又没有前途的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...meaningless, dead-end job...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,办公室里的人根本不知道我的存在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and nobody here even knows that I exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他们都知道你的存在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm sure that people know you exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我在一个小房间里工作  四周都是人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah? I work in a cubicle surrounded by people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经跟你谈了五分钟  我要自杀的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been talking to you for five minutes now about killing myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人抬头起来看我一眼   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and no one's even looked up from their desk. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  大伙们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要自杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm gonna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不理我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  如果有人问起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, if anybody asks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字  就叫萝希塔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your name is Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的小东西  她是英年早逝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Poor thing. Cut down in her prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  新椅子一小时内就会送来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, the new chair will be here in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们该把萝希塔搬出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we should actually move Rosita out of here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始疗伤止痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Start the healing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我想你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I guess you're right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她恢复了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太奇怪了  不  一点都不奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's weird. No, it's not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是奇迹  乔伊  我相信这一定有合理的解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a miracle, Joey. I'm sure there's an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  只要你的心地纯正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is. If you want something enough and your heart is pure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹一定会发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...wondrous things can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会了解的   我不是故意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, she'll understand, right? It's not like I did it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  对她来说那并不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad, that won't matter to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  我的箱子完全没事  她的东西都\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, all my stuff is safe and dry. And all her stuff is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长出新的东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...growing new stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, this is exactly the kind of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才让她认为你们爱我更胜于爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that makes her think you guys love me more than you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  她真的那么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Does she really think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能怪她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, can you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  或许我们在潜意识里  是偏爱你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I suppose we may have favored you unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were a medical marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说你妈没办法  我不想听了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The doctors said your mom couldn't-I don't want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   现在不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Well, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡来这里要找寻回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look. Monica came here for some memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的   我们得给她一些回忆啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, we're gonna give her some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  拿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, grab...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把空箱子拿过来  要把我的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Grab some empty boxes, okay? We'll take stuff from mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放在这些箱子里  只要能骗过她的就行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and whatever we can pass off as hers, we'll put them in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,譬如说  这个  这可能是她做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Like, this. She could have made this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是她的  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This could have been hers. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是告诉我那个"医学奇迹" 的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, if you want to tell the medical marvel story while we work...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,适当时机了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好高兴能把这张椅子  留下来自己用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so psyched I kept this chair for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这张椅子的头垫上  还附了喇叭吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you know, that this thing has speakers in the headrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  真的吗  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把它跟电视机接在一起  还可以听收音机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can hook it up to your TV and you get radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的椅子有自疗的功能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My chair heals itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们别提办公室的同事了  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Earl, let's just forget about the people at the office, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定有人值得你留恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's gotta be someone else in your life that's worth sticking around for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的家人跟朋友呢  或许你有女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about your family or friends? Or maybe a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  抱歉  你的男朋友呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sorry. Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去做我想做的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should probably be getting back to my thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有说完  你休想挂我电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not finished yet. Don't you dare hang up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新来的女同事真的有一套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The new girl's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪些箱子是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So which boxes are mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的箱子都在这里  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These are yours right here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,着色簿  对  是你喜欢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, a coloring book. Yeah, yeah. Oh, you loved that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里都会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You always had it with you. You never went anywhere without--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会带着那本着色簿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Without that coloring book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我老是没办法   把颜色涂在线里面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Looks like I had some trouble staying inside the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信以前我穿得下这件了恤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I even fit into this shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（暴龙  罗斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  这是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道它怎么会跑到那里去的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know how that got in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  这不是我的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, this isn't my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  这些是你的箱子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, these are your boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的箱子在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are my boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车库淹水  甜心  你的箱子都进了水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The garage flooded, sweetie, and it ruined everything in your boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我的箱子进水了  恐怕是那样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just mine? I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么罗斯的东西都没坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So why wasn't Ross' stuff ruined?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用你的箱子挡水  来保护我的保时捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used your boxes to divert water away from the Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯的东西都没事  但我什么回忆都没有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So wait. Ross' stuff is fine, but I have no memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了你不希望  你的汽车底盘碰到水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you wanted to keep the bottom two inches of your car from water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水里有树叶  泥巴跟杂物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there was also leaves and gook and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去他的  我要抽根烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Screw it. I'm having one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  钱德  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要试试看一张可以平躺着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How would you like to sit in a chair that fully reclines...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有滚轮按摩功能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...has a rolling massage...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,头垫还附了喇叭的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and speakers in the headrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我倒是喜欢  但试过很多次了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'd love to, but I've tried that so many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经不让我进他们店里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they won't even let me in the store anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我说  你可以到我家试坐一下呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what if I told you that you could do it in my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you telling me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你买了那张  让其他椅子都变成废物的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that you bought the chair that is making all other lounge systems obsolete?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那张《椅子杂志》封为  "年度最佳椅子"的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The chair that Sit Magazine called "Chair of the Year"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚买了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just purchased...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懒男孩E倾斜3000型\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the La-Z-Boy E-Cliner 3000.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  真的是太棒了  太帅了  你为什么会买呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's awesome. That's great. What made you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长  是我弄坏了乔伊的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's a long story, but I broke Joey's chair--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  是你弄坏了乔伊的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa. You broke Joey's chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是我干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I thought I broke Joey's chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我用我的椅子跟它调了包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's why I replaced it with mine. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以它才会恢复了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's how it got fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为呢  是妖精把它修好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what did you think? That elves came in and fixed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是天使干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把我的椅子拿回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting my chair back. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来它根本没有自疗功能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, looks like it wasn't healed after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这张椅子是我的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I guess this chair's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你弄坏了我的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you broke my chair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以为他把它弄坏了  所以他调换了椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he thought he broke your chair, so he switched the chairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹根本不存在  没错  乔伊  奇迹不存在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So there was no miracle? No, Joe. No miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  这真的是太糟糕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. This is devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的信念被击垮了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My faith is shaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴  这张新椅子能陪我走过这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad I have the new chair to get me through this difficult time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问  厄尔在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, could you tell me where can I find Earl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是总务部经理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's the supply manager here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不认识厄尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry, I don't know any Earl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厄尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Earl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是菲比  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Phoebe. Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖碳粉的小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The lady who sells toner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你不能自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, look, you can't kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激你能赶过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, urn, I really appreciate you coming down--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我不能让你那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I can't let you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为命运让我今天打电话给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it was fate that made me call you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你打电话来是要卖碳粉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it was toner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:18:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好想一想吧  好吗  这根本不是我的正职\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Think about it, okay? This isn't even my regular job, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一天上班  第一个电话就打给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And my first day on the job, you're my first call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人可能会挂掉电话   但我不会那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And somebody else might have hung up on you, but I wouldn't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我了解这种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I know about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈是自杀的  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My morn killed herself. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么自杀的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会教你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna give you tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看不出来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, don't you see that this--?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是命中注定的  所以才有我来阻止你自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This all came together so that I could stop you from doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道不是巧合吗  不  这是命中注定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Couldn't it just be a coincidence? No, it's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来不像是命中注定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't really seem like enough to be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  好吧  好吧  有件事很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well. Um, okay, here's a weird thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈也是总务部经理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My mother was also a supply manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我是办公室经理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm actually the office manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  她也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. So was she!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And get this, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是厄尔  对吧  她叫做普厄儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your name is Earl, right? Her name was Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普厄尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的证据吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪里人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费城  喔  我的天啊  她也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Philadelphia. Oh, my God, so was she!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都起鸡皮疙瘩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I've got goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿的太多了  这里又很热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm wearing layers, and it's warm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这些混蛋根本不在乎你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But-Look. Okay. These jerks might not care about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但宇宙在乎你  那才是最重要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but the universe does, and that says a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要你们在乎我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't need you guys to care about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为宇宙在乎我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because the universe cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个宇宙在乎我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The whole universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的希望他们也能在乎我一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really wish they'd care just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  这真的是太可怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的东西都毁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它一定很重要我才会保存它  现在我看不出来它是什么东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It obviously meant enough for me to save it, and now I can't tell what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它还软软的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's still soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得它是什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想它是老鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, I think it was a mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  甜心  你觉得呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you, honey? How do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你毁了我的童年回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've wrecked all my childhood memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们爱罗斯比爱我多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you love Ross more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚还拿了死老鼠贴着我的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I just rubbed a dead mouse on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  我们爱你就像我们爱罗斯一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweetheart, we love you just as much as Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,箱子的事我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I'm sorry about everything that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我永远没办法补偿你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I'll probably never be able to make it up to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是个开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but here's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  我的保时捷的钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's this? It's the key to my Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的保时捷的钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, the key to your Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想把它卖掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been thinking of getting rid of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天我在车子里看到了自己的倒影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I was driving it the other day and I saw my reflection in a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:21:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈说的对  我看起来像个瘪三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your mother's right, I do look like an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把它送给我  你一定是在开玩笑  对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're giving it to me? You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几箱蠢东西湿掉了  她就可以拿到保时捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, a couple of stupid boxes get wet, and she gets a Porsche?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去兜个风吧  太帅了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't we take it for a spin? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我呢  我是医学奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about me? I'm a medical marvel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们都在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看到钱德的椅子  巴卡兰格了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Know what happened to Chandler's Barcalounger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊把它弄坏了  后来他把它丢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Joey broke it. Had to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗  我得到了保时捷  而且巴卡兰格被丢掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? I get a Porsche and the Barcaloungers gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是有史以来最棒的一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. This is the best day ever!
